#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "CA Bundle File"
msgstr "Faili ya Kifurushi cha CA"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "For the CA bundle mode: absolute path on the poller to a PEM file that others cannot write."
msgstr "Kwa hali ya kifurushi cha CA: njia kamili kwenye poller kwenda kwenye faili ya PEM ambayo wengine hawawezi kuiandika."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "For the pinned mode: base64 SHA-256 of the BMC public key, as sha256//... or the bare hash. A changed key fails until this is updated."
msgstr "Kwa hali iliyopiniwa: base64 SHA-256 ya ufunguo wa umma wa BMC, kama sha256//... au hashi tupu. Ufunguo uliobadilika hushindwa hadi hii isasishwe."

