msgid "Allow Basic Authentication Fallback"
msgstr "Ruhusu Mbadala wa Uthibitishaji wa Basic"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Used only when the BMC offers no session service. Every request then carries the password; the health page warns while it is in use."
msgstr "Inatumika tu wakati BMC haitoi huduma ya kipindi. Kila ombi hubeba nenosiri; ukurasa wa afya huonyesha onyo wakati inatumika."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "The Cacti device of the server this BMC manages. Leave it at none to have the plugin create a device from the list."
msgstr "Kifaa cha Cacti cha seva ambayo BMC hii inasimamia. Kiache bila chochote ili programu-jalizi iunde kifaa kutoka kwenye orodha."

