#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed completely. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Violezo vya Redfish havijasakinishwa kikamilifu. Visakinishe tena kutoka kwenye ukurasa wa BMC za Redfish."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "A device \"%s\" from the %s device template, polled by poller %d, with availability checks off. Its host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Kifaa \\\"%s\\\" kutoka kwenye kiolezo cha kifaa cha %s, kinachokusanywa na poller %d, kikiwa na ukaguzi wa upatikanaji umezimwa. Jina lake la seva pangishi ni jina lililohifadhiwa ambalo haliwasilianwi kamwe."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data query \"%s\", with a graph for each of the %d members known now."
msgstr "Hoja ya data \\\"%s\\\", yenye grafu kwa kila mojawapo ya vipengele %d vinavyojulikana sasa."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d fans or power supplies that were present are no longer reported. They count as failed until you confirm; confirming accepts the members the BMC reports now."
msgstr "Feni au vifaa vya usambazaji umeme %d vilivyokuwepo haviripotiwi tena. Vinahesabiwa kama vilivyoshindwa hadi utakapothibitisha; kuthibitisha kunakubali vipengele ambavyo BMC inaripoti sasa."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The graph \"%s\", with its \"%s\" data source."
msgstr "Grafu \\\"%s\\\", yenye chanzo chake cha data \\\"%s\\\"."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC is already mapped to a device."
msgstr "BMC tayari imeunganishwa na kifaa."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "Created by the Redfish plugin for BMC %s. Its values come from the plugin cache; the host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Imeundwa na programu-jalizi ya Redfish kwa BMC %s. Thamani zake zinatoka kwenye akiba ya programu-jalizi; jina la seva pangishi ni jina lililohifadhiwa ambalo haliwasilianwi kamwe."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "Cacti refused to create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Cacti ilikataa kuunda kifaa. Angalia kumbukumbu ya Cacti."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The new device would be hidden from you by your device permissions, so it was removed again. Ask an administrator to grant access, or map the BMC to a device you can see."
msgstr "Kifaa kipya kingefichwa kwako na ruhusa zako za kifaa, kwa hivyo kiliondolewa tena. Omba msimamizi akupe ufikiaji, au unganisha BMC na kifaa unachoweza kukiona."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC was mapped to a device by someone else meanwhile, or could not be mapped, so the new device was removed again. Reload the page and check its mapping."
msgstr "BMC iliunganishwa na kifaa na mtu mwingine wakati huo, au haikuweza kuunganishwa, kwa hivyo kifaa kipya kiliondolewa tena. Pakia upya ukurasa na uangalie muunganisho wake."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Redfish templates could not be installed: %s"
msgstr "Violezo vya Redfish havikuweza kusakinishwa: %s"

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed or not current. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Violezo vya Redfish havijasakinishwa au si vya sasa. Visakinishe tena kutoka kwenye ukurasa wa BMC za Redfish."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its Cacti device was deleted. Map it to another device or create one from the BMCs page."
msgstr "%s: kifaa chake cha Cacti kilifutwa. Kiunganishe na kifaa kingine au unda kimoja kutoka kwenye ukurasa wa BMC."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its device is polled by poller %d but the BMC is read by poller %d. Move one of them so both use the same poller, or its graphs can read as unknown."
msgstr "%s: kifaa chake kinakusanywa na poller %d lakini BMC inasomwa na poller %d. Hamisha kimojawapo ili vyote viwili vitumie poller sawa, la sivyo grafu zake zinaweza kusoma kama hazijulikani."

